Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:17.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is going to be quite a chore to find just one book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:25.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She couldn't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.86,0:00:31.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.91,0:00:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want, scarred man?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:40.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.87,0:00:42.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there's no way you could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.25,0:00:44.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I smell something, I smell something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:47.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the smell of an Ishbalan, covered with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You intend to involve yourself with \Nthe Fullmetal pipsqueak, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.59,0:00:57.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.18,0:01:00.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We still need the boy to pursue the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.93,0:01:02.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.98,0:01:05.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, perhaps I said too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.14,0:01:08.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I eat this one too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.95,0:01:21.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:26.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:31.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.67,0:01:37.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:20.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're here! Central!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:21.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Phew!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about we head for the first branch right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.95,0:03:29.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to hurry.\NThe library isn't going to run off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:32.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've finally got a definite lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:34.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit still now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:39.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major Armstrong,\Nwe have come to greet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.59,0:03:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will be proceeding directly to the command center,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:47.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so you will be in charge of\Nguarding these two from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:49.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Maria Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:51.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Denny Brosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:55.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an honor to meet you, Fullmetal Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:58.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're dressed just as your second name implies!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:04:02.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You do indeed wear it with dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:02.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.41,0:04:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh, I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.16,0:04:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then it's this little fellow—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:09.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No, I meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:11.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you were\Ngoing to be a child like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:12.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aah, enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.67,0:04:15.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major! We don't need any guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.71,0:04:17.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The two of us are both\Nperfectly put back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:19.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really would like to\Nlet you go as well, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:25.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have received information that Scar has appeared again in Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.34,0:04:27.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:29.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just put up with it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.73,0:04:34.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fullmetal Alchemist,\Nplease leave everything to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:37.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just hope you don't\Nslow me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:41.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, we have a car waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:44.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's always like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:48.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't let it bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:56.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Despite how he appears, he has \Novercome a bitter past many times...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.79,0:04:58.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please overlook his behavior for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:02.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Right... \NBut actually, as it happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:08.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Last night, the first branch was all but \Ncompletely lost due to a fire that broke out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:11.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:13.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to eyewitness reports,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:16.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we suspect that it was the act of Scar,\Nwho is on our wanted list.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:22.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:25.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our lead is burned to a crisp...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.45,0:05:31.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really! Seriously, seriously! I want you to hear her too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.37,0:05:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's a prodigy!\NAnd she's only three years old!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:37.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She has an angelic singing voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:39.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That settles it!\NShe's going to be a future songstress!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:42.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Colonel, I'm working here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.05,0:05:45.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Fancy that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.84,0:05:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm working too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:48.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.89,0:05:52.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there is any alchemy that can burn someone up on the other end of the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You say such frightening things,\NFlame Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:58.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, about that other matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:03.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to eyewitness testimony,\Nwe're certain that Scar was involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:07.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, looking at the site, I can't\Nbelieve it was the work of him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:10.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is evidence that he was fighting with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Any news on Scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Signs of fighting continue on away from the building site into the sewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:21.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We discovered his bloodstained clothes further downstream,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:22.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but we're not sure\Nif he's alive or dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:26.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now in Central, following the death of Brigadier General Grand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:30.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there are plausible rumors going around that Colonel Mustang will be returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:36.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then again, there are others that are putting forward the misdirected notion
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.89,0:06:36.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that you're the one\Nbehind the disturbances.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:38.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm, how ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:39.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:41.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Returning to Central, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:43.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.48,0:06:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch yourself. You've got a lot of enemies among the higher-ups right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.41,0:06:54.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make as many friends as you can, \Nwho understand you and will support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:57.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means,\Nas soon as you can...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:06:59.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,find yourself a wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:00.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.50,0:07:02.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel, take it easy on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.42,0:07:04.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Colonel! Don't sit up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been searching\Nsince this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:11.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but these are the only books we were able to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:13.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:15.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:22.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, there aren't any books \Nauthored by Tim Marcoh in the main building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.23,0:07:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they had been moved there\Nfrom the branch,\Nthere should be\Na record of it, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.11,0:07:30.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, is there any possibility that it was checked out by anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.95,0:07:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, but since the circulation records were also burned up...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:36.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:39.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was probably burned up\Ntogether with all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:44.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only we could have confirmed that his book was really even in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.00,0:07:47.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was there anyone else\Nwho worked there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:51.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He and I were the only people on staff in that branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.59,0:07:52.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.93,0:07:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only State Alchemists were\Npermitted in the branch, and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:08:01.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I remember there being\Na young lady there who wore glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.02,0:08:04.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, you mean Scieszka?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:06.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was fired a little while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:07.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.65,0:08:10.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl was a little unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.24,0:08:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scieszka was a bookworm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.07,0:08:13.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Worm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess she isn't home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.12,0:08:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The lights are on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's open it!\NYou can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:28.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a mountain of books!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:31.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does someone actually live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:34.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scieszka-san, are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:36.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scieszka-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.43,0:08:39.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:43.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:49.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's someone...\NThere's someone buried here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.73,0:08:51.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dig! Dig! Just keep digging!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.33,0:09:02.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.37,0:09:04.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I inadvertently knocked over\Nthat pile of books.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:07.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't breathe,\Nand I thought I was going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:11.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scieszka-san, you used to work at the first branch, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.67,0:09:12.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.09,0:09:17.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I ever did was read books while I was working, so I got fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:21.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to support my sick mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:25.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I'm just no good at anything besides reading books.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.39,0:09:29.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, anyhow, Scieszka-san, \Ndo you remember there being a book
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:31.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,authored by someone named Tim Marcoh at the branch?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:33.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tim Marcoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:37.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would probably be a thick,\Nhandwritten research journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:41.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A thick, handwritten research journal...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:42.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,by Tim Marcoh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.79,0:09:47.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.79,0:09:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was a leather-bound book, \Nwith handwritten manuscripts inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:53.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:53.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:56.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I remember all of the books in the branch's collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:58.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which would mean, sure enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:01.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn. We're right back\Nwhere we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:03.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:11.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sure is sad when you can't find a book you want to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.65,0:10:14.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that feeling terribly well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.15,0:10:19.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(310,508)}I, too, once wandered among this mountain of books for nearly three days,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:23.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\pos(310,508)}but I still did not find the \None volume I wanted to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:26.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so, so sad...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:31.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Scieszka-san, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:34.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With your help, we at least\Nconfirmed that the book existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:36.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll manage to do\Nsomething from here on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.47,0:10:38.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, there's still\Nsome other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:44.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to transmute the cinders of all the burned books back to their original form!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:47.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible! Can you really do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:49.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch closely!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:55.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, what about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it okay for that stuff\Nto go flying off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:03.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard you try, it'll be impossible, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:08.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, if you would like,\Nshall I reproduce the book for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:13.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I remember the entire contents of a book once I read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:16.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And since I've read most of the books in the branch...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:20.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you really do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a silly little talent I have, but if I can help you out...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:29.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:30.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was a lot of content,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:32.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so it took me three whole days\Nto write it all down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:37.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Marcoh-san's\Nresearch journal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:38.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:39.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.78,0:11:44.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything from light and easy {\i1}hors d'oeuvres{\i0}, \Nto party dinners you'd invite guests to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.45,0:11:47.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tim Marcoh's "1,000 Recipes for Today's Menus"!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:50.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.75,0:11:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}One tablespoon of sugar,\Na pinch of salt and pepper...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.96,0:12:01.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This really is today's menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.55,0:12:04.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you didn't get the wrong author?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:08.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not serious! All I did was reproduce what I was told to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.22,0:12:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was all in vain, I'm sorry to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:11.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're sure that, word for word, this is \Nthe same thing that Marcoh-san wrote?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:18.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.48,0:12:20.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:21.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks!\NLt. Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.53,0:12:24.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give Scieszka this amount of money for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:29.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you go to State Alchemist Services with my references there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.83,0:12:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they'll take it out of my\Nresearch budget for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:32.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:36.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:37.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sergeant, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:43.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is he planning to do with a book like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:45.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Indeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That much?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:55.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For him to pay out\Nthis amount all at once,\Nhe sure is a State Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:59.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, please!\NWhere are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:02.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to hole up in the Central Library for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:05.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They have abundant materials and dictionaries, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.49,0:13:06.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:09.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar's whereabouts are still unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:12.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't guard you in\Nsuch a high-traffic area!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:15.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you can report that to your superiors,\Nor whatever else you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:17.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is our problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:23.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've finally found ourselves a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:24.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.51,0:13:32.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marcoh-san's research journal...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:36.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It definitely appears to be\Nan ordinary cookbook at first glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:39.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The secret to the Philosopher's Stone\Nis written in here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.73,0:13:43.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's encoded, to protect\Nagainst it being misused.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:47.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They do say that alchemy was born in the kitchen, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.70,0:13:49.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With me working on this, it'll be a piece of cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:29.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And here I thought I could solve this right away...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is one hard code to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:35.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only we could ask\NMarcoh-san directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:38.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He abandoned his research.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't very well\Nrely on him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:43.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo, Ed, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you doing all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel! What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.67,0:14:48.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We haven't seen you around at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.93,0:14:52.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Scar's appearance.\NHe's got us running all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:55.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, did you get your body fixed up all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.10,0:14:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.56,0:14:59.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those two are on familiar terms with the Lt. Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.31,0:15:03.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel Hughes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:07.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If anything were to happen here,\Nwe could not ensure the safety of these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:08.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They should return to quarters at the Command Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.20,0:15:10.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I asked you to leave us alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.49,0:15:13.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as we do not know\Nwhere Scar is,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:15.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we should reexamine\Nour security structure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:19.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Ross is definitely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.33,0:15:23.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, I can't make the call\Non my own authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:25.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you ask Major Armstrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:28.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Please, not him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:28.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, not him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.09,0:15:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:34.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just one step away.\NI'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:38.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm at a point where I can't do\Nvery much about the Scar matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.23,0:15:42.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On top of that, all the case records have been burned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:44.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There isn't any work to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:47.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Case records?\NThose were at the branch as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.65,0:15:48.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:51.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Affidavit records,\Nlists of names, the whole bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:53.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.29,0:15:57.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.00,0:16:03.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, sure, I've read the military's \Ncriminal records and lists of convicts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:05.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.67,0:16:09.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If what you say is true,\Nthis will help us out greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.55,0:16:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll vouch for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:12.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're going to hire her, now's the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.84,0:16:13.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.01,0:16:18.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To think that I,\Nwhose only ability is reading,\Nwould become part of\Nthe Court-Martial Office...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:19.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.98,0:16:23.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Working at something really hard is a talent in and of itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.35,0:16:28.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have an incredible memory, after all.\NI think you should be proud of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:33.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.95,0:16:36.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, I will do the best I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.87,0:16:38.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your consideration!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.45,0:16:41.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Now that that's settled, let's get right to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:44.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I pay handsomely!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:45.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.21,0:16:52.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I've got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:56.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll send someone from the\NCourt-Martial Office to cover library security.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:17:00.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh? Thanks, man. And I didn't even mean for this to happen, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:01.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:05.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:06.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go\Nworking on that too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:11.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a moment please, Lt. Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:14.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Ross...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know what you're going to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.74,0:17:21.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but they are not the kind of guys \Nwho give up easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:24.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll dispatch additional men to you by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.16,0:17:26.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you to make do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:29.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you supporting them this much?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:32.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Letting them continue to work,\Nwhen you know the danger to them...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:34.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those boys are still children!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.93,0:17:36.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is why we're protecting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:40.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now, what they're doing is something that only they can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is the role of us adults to\Nwatch over children like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:46.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I leave you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.55,0:19:02.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're homunculi, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.51,0:19:07.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, there are still humans \Nwho believe in our existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.29,0:19:29.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't get to eat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:32.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would've liked to have verified Marcoh's research journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:35.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But now there's no need to, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.27,0:19:49.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.44,0:19:53.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a surprise. I didn't think\Nyou were going to come back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.53,0:19:57.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:20:00.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mister, you're an Ishbalan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.49,0:20:05.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a town of Ishbalans!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:15.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandpa! He's back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:20.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've held on to your life,\Nyoung one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:26.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the guy, aren't you?\NThe one on the wanted list.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:28.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.77,0:20:31.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no one here who would sell out one of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.14,0:20:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had no idea there were\Nthis many surviving Ishbalans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.90,0:20:38.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not just here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are little villages all over the land,\Nand everyone is still going strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.28,0:20:49.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"The entire world is the\Nbosom of our god, Ishbala."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:04.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No results today either, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:09.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it is that they're studying,\Nbut I wish they would\Nthrow in the towel already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.22,0:21:12.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those boys won't give up until they've found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.19,0:21:16.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it's our job to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:20.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.86,0:21:23.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.65,0:21:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the reason\Nthis is called the devil's research...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.41,0:21:29.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the reason Marcoh-san\Nabandoned his research...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.24,0:21:30.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.45,0:21:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.45,0:21:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The material needed for making a Philosopher's Stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:36.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is live human beings!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:40.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.92,0:21:43.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And here I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.13,0:21:46.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I finally thought it was\Nwithin our grasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.47,0:21:52.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.93,0:21:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.89,0:21:56.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}could{\i0} just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.02,0:21:58.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.77,0:22:02.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am a person who has\Nbetrayed the way of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.61,0:22:10.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That arm is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.53,0:22:11.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.37,0:22:20.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's something very precious\Ngiven to me by my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.66,0:23:40.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.25,0:23:44.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 19: "The Truth Behind Truths"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.34,0:23:46.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Central 5th Laboratory...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.05,0:23:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is a hell there\Nthat we were unaware of.
